  #line-at(72.024pt, 156.98pt, "the inset image shows the Au NPs film with size approximately 20-25 nm. The cross-section ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 177.74pt, "image in Figure 3 (b) shows that grown ZnO micro rod arrays are vertically aligned along the ")
