  #line-at(72.024pt, 646.99pt, "PBTTT-C14 polymer film when excited with an excitation wavelength of 325 nm. It shows the ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 667.78pt, "wavelength range of emission spectra of the PBTTT-C14 thin film. It can be seen from Figure ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 688.42pt, "4 (b) that the PBTTT-C14 thin film shows PL between 600─800 nm, and a maximum emission ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 709.18pt, "at 660 nm hence making it suitable for visible photo sensing applications. ")
